{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は早朝よりもちょっと早い時間から動いてるので\nもういま眠たくてしょうがないです！( ¯•ω•¯ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアウィーヴを目の前に敷かれたら\n一瞬で寝てしまいます(｡-_-｡)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、立ちながらブログ書いてるよっ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書いてる途中に寝ちゃうとだめだからっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日はね、楽しみな撮影があるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もともとなかったんだけど、\n本当に本当に10代最後の撮影です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがね、またね、情報解禁されたら\n話しますが、1つ目標としてたことが\n叶ったのー٩(ˊᗜˋ*)و！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10代最後の撮影で\n1つの目標を叶えさせてもらったので\n20代からの撮影ではもっと\nいろいろな自分を出せるように頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月刊エンタメさんの\nSNSに載せて頂きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7月30日 発売です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏の撮影は\nソーダ味のアイス棒を\n毎年持ってます(｡・・｡)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイス好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、音楽の日に乃木坂46出演させて頂きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"14時30分頃～と\n18時40分頃～の予定ですが\n時間は前後すると思うので\nずーーっと見ててくださいねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15枚目選抜になっての歌番組出演は\n明日の音楽の日が初めてなので\nこれが放送されて家に帰って\n録画したものを家族で見るときに\nまた選抜メンバーということに\n実感しそう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8枚目シングルの頃よりも\n何倍も何十倍もレベルアップした姿を\nみなさんに見ていただけるように\nがんばります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型なににしよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！最後に蘭世ちゃんのかわいい写真を\n皆さんに公開しちゃいます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の冬に別冊カドカワさんで\n蘭世と2人で巻末グラビアインタビュー撮影を\nさせて頂いた時のです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観覧車に乗ってるシーンがあったんだけど\n観覧車の中の写真はカメラマンさんじゃなくて\n私にしかとれなかったんだよっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと一緒に乗ってる気分になれちゃう\n蘭世ちゃんの写真！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世ちゃんとお話しがしたいよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/16/2727335/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}